<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$384.8 mln trade deficit in August.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$384.8 mln trade deficit in August.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Wednesday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for August.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Aug 1996	  July 1996	  Aug 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$384.8 million     -$106.3 million	-$252.8 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.65 billion   $1.83 bln	   $1.70 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $2.04 billion   $1.94 bln	   $1.95 bln</p>
</text>
